Extension setting for the experimental LSP support

Language servers (from .lsp.json files and extensions such as Claude plugins
with a .lsp.json) only start with --experimental-lsp, and the extension
starts its daemon and ACP process without CLI options of the user's. The new
setting qwen-code.experimentalLsp (off by default) adds the flag to both.

